{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2021-12", "window": 3, "start_date": 1639612800, "end_date": 1640303999, "month_true_total": 2703, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:02:48 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "106389285", "author": {"steamid": "76561198851889043", "personaname": "thealcoholic_bear", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/HomoRutger/", "num_games_owned": 87, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 28418, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 318, "last_played": 1783169368, "avatar": "9b5a2b4dd7585627c31986006f0ce218f318ddc7"}, "language": "english", "review": "mf gives me cancer", "timestamp_created": 1640303602, "timestamp_updated": 1640303602, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "106389275", "author": {"steamid": "76561198074130384", "personaname": "Ceaiu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198074130384/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 9661, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2742, "last_played": 1771255714, "avatar": "0fa258cd947b4f44867456b8e4a1572da55ff0bc"}, "language": "english", "review": ":D", "timestamp_created": 1640303590, "timestamp_updated": 1640303590, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "106389174", "author": {"steamid": "76561198088129895", "personaname": "Maddus_", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/maddus/", "num_games_owned": 244, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 24401, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12896, "last_played": 1780365881, "avatar": "cd2b5e02b3075e76a553ece99bfd727748438c4d"}, "language": "english", "review": "space ninjas go brrr\nJoking aside, the game is fun, but not without it's problems. For one, looter-shooters might not be for everybody, and the grind might not be appealing to some. I find it acceptable because the movement and the combat is fun when you can run circles around your opponents at mach-♥♥♥♥\nThe starter warframes are still viable well into the mid-game, as Excalibur has served me well since I started. The starter frames are also not inaccessible after the tutorial either, as parts can be found in Clan Dojos.\nMy main complaints are a bit nitpicky. For one, the game likes to think it's Clash of Clans sometimes. Use of the foundry takes way too long for anything. Three days for a new warframe is a bit crazy. On top of that, some quests [spoiler]Rising Tide[/spoiler] are very expensive. The credit cost alone is about 6 million to build a Railjack. Aside from all that, the story is good and the gameplay is fun. Would recommend.", "timestamp_created": 1640303473, "timestamp_updated": 1640303473, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "106388357", "author": {"steamid": "76561198432211984", "personaname": "Homunculus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198432211984/", "num_games_owned": 57, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 53254, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 53171, "last_played": 1721163842, "avatar": "50767cea96889a121066ed45c098873cb258f8f3"}, "language": "english", "review": "game good i like", "timestamp_created": 1640302499, "timestamp_updated": 1640302499, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "106387932", "author": {"steamid": "76561198225953896", "personaname": "JoJo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/punch1301/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 4641, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2578, "last_played": 1695902859, "avatar": "ae540d37eef3cfcff194166b7325340a698fe0e0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pros - \n1. Best fast-paced combat system in any game created. \n2. Stunning effects. \n3. Nice community. Everyone is helpful, no toxicity whatsoever. \n4. Lots of content.\n5. Devs care about the game and popularity is not decreasing after all those years.\n6. Has a long future ahead of it and seems to get only better with time. \n7. Very well optimized. \n8. Free (Entirely free, unlike Destiny 2).\n9. Not pay to win (although still pay to get there faster).\n10. Massive customization options. \n11. Your main menu is your in-game ♥♥♥♥♥♥' spaceship!!!\n\nCons -\n1. No pvp. Nor at all. Please do something about it ;( \n2. Blueprints... Seriously... Why?  And 24 hours as well? Oh God. \n\n\nStill, best free MMO on the market. \n\n", "timestamp_created": 1640302035, "timestamp_updated": 1640302035, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}